    "intro_narrative": "The world ended not with a bang, but with a suffocating silence. You stand in the heart of Outpost 31, a forgotten underground facility that once promised salvation. The air is thick with the metallic tang of ozone and radioactive dust. The emergency lights bathe the cracked concrete walls in a sickly crimson glow. Your Geiger counter clicks nervously in the background, a constant reminder that time is running out. Your ultimate goal is to reactivate the main generator core, the only thing standing between you and freezing to death in the endless nuclear winter. However, the facility's systems have been heavily compartmentalized and damaged. You will need to explore the desolate sector, salvage what you can from the fallen, and carefully re-establish the power grid step by step. Every machine, every console, and every scrapped component holds a piece of the puzzle. Beware the malfunctioning security systems and trust your wits to survive the wasteland's ghosts.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
